---
description: Pinned release candidate + environment → GO / GO_WITH_CONTROLS / NO_GO / DEFER. Score never overrides binding gates.
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user names a **build, RC, artifact, commit, or deploy target** and asks if it
is **ready for production**, run a **release gate**, or needs GO/NO_GO/DEFER — load
`release-readiness`.

Requires identifiable **release candidate** and **environment**. Run
`scripts/readiness_engine.py` and `scripts/bootstrap_manifest.py` when manifest JSON
is available.

Do not use for whole-project gap roadmaps (`repo-to-roadmap`) or weekly prioritization
(`product-operator`). Verdict is assessment evidence, not deploy authorization.
